                            <p>The criteria spell out what each score means for each dimension. Extract from the <em>Domain Modeling</em> dimension — the benchmark author chose a 0–25 scale here; your own criteria can use any scale that fits (0–5, 0–10, named levels, pass/fail, whatever):</p>
